WEBVTT

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:02.503
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:04.729
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What do you want to do?

00:00:06.722 --> 00:00:07.304
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.335 --> 00:00:09.780
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I won’t be here tomorrow.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.390
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.901
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I won’t go to the party.

00:00:16.915 --> 00:00:17.508
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:18.507 --> 00:00:20.078
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I want to go to the party.

00:00:22.098 --> 00:00:22.795
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.250
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> It won’t be very warm.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.047
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:28.989 --> 00:00:30.273
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Do you want to come with me?